  "notes": "Same start correction as Carbuncle Debacle -- the header's giver is a cutscene, the House of the Hero is the entity. Bullet 4 says the three NPCs may be visited 'in any order', so they share a group and all three draw at once; a strict ladder would mark Fuepepe alone. Fuepepe and Furakku-Norakku are in Windurst Waters (North), which is one half of zone 238 and not a zone of its own. Shantotto hands out several quests, so the page warns you may have to talk past them -- recorded as a note, since nothing observable distinguishes the right conversation.",
