  "notes": "This quest is ABSENT from v1 entirely -- chronicle could not resolve a giver written as '??? (Carbuncle)' -- so anything here is a gain and nothing can be lost. Start is read as Carbuncle, who bullet 1 says you speak to; if the live entity turns out to be a bare ??? the marker simply never appears, which is exactly today's behaviour. The six avatar battles are ONE step, not six: the page never names the six avatars anywhere in the walkthrough, only their six key items, and inventing Ifrit and Shiva from the reward list would be exactly the guessing this rebuild exists to avoid. That step therefore carries all six key items as a single AND-list, which is right -- bullet 4 says you need all six before the last battle. Bullets 8 to 17 are rewards, a weekly Conquest Tally cooldown and a two-Summoner strategy; none is a step. Full Moon Fountain is in OBJECT_DENY as an NPC name but resolves as a ZONE, so the final battle keeps a place and loses only its marker.",
